     says the carries side reports its revision via "SaveWithRevision, used by
     handleWhatIfSettings/saveAndRecalc". handleWhatIfSettings — the route this very test
     exercises — does NOT use SaveWithRevision; it calls
     retirementMgr.UpdateSettings/UpdateSettingsWithPersons (handlers_rates.go:53-58), which
     bump and return sm.revision directly under their own write lock
     (internal/services/retirement/settings.go:1112-1131 and :1202) and never route through
     SaveWithRevision (settings.go:723). Only saveAndRecalc (handlers.go:212) uses
     SaveWithRevision. The comment conflates the two revision-reporting paths; since X6's
     stated purpose included repairing a stale comment on this test, the lead may want it
     corrected. No effect on any assertion.
